  Slug: stalker-in-darkened-boughs
  DisplayName: Stalker in Darkened Boughs
  IconPath: icons/environment/wilderness/terrain-forest-gray.webp
  Description: 'Stalkers in darkened boughs make their homes in ancient forests and
    jungles unfriendly to humanoids and others who would exert control or influence
    over nature''s designs. These apparitions are drawn to animists who harbor violent
    thoughts or impulses but are more likely to linger with animists who can quell
    their hatred. Stalkers in darkened boughs are moody, impulsive, and prone to
    seeing things from the least charitable perspective. Apparition Skills Forest
    Lore, Hunting Lore Apparition Spells Cantrip @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Gouging
    Claw] 1st @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Runic Body] 2nd @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Vomit
    Swarm] 3rd @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Wall of Thorns] 4th @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Bestial
    Curse] 5th @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Moon Frenzy] 6th @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Tangling
    Creepers] 7th @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Unfettered Pack] 8th @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Monstrosity
    Form] 9th @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Wrathful Storm] Vessel Spell
    @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Darkened Forest Form] Avatar Beast of the
    Boughs Speed 70 feet, fly Speed 70 feet Melee 1 devouring jaws (deadly 3d10,
    reach 15 feet), Damage @Damage[(6d10+6)[piercing]]'
